## Day 77 — Session Plan (3 tasks)

### Task 1: Selective context summarization — `/compact N` (self-driven, competitive gap)
The #1 actionable competitive gap from the assessment. Claude Code has "summarize up to here" — we don't. Adding /compact N lets users control how many recent turns stay at full fidelity while aggressively summarizing everything before them. Touches commands_session.rs, `help.rs, dispatch.rs`.

### Task 2: Fix `--print` mode leaking chrome (self-discovered bug)
print_usage() and print_context_usage() don't check is_quiet(), so --print mode still shows cost/context lines that break programmatic usage. Two one-line guards in format/mod.rs.

### Task 3: Add unit tests for `tool_wrappers.rs` (test coverage)
Worst coverage ratio of important files at 60 lines/test. Adding ~11 tests for ToolFailureTracker, truncate_result, and describe_file_operation edge cases — all currently at 0 test coverage.

